-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  dir_err_exeicon_ext.adam - Break step of dir_exeicon_noext: an @exeicon
  naming another extension (.png) is SM0625 at its path, never replaced
  (that could pick another file); the file is not looked for (PLAN-EXT X4)
*******************************************************************************/

/*
@@test
  kind error
@@end
*/

module exe dir_err_exeicon_ext;

@exeicon "$P:res/tests/exe/fixtures/dir_exeicon_noext/app.png"; // ERROR SM0625@10: @exeicon names '$P:res/tests/exe/fixtures/dir_exeicon_noext/app.png', which is not a .ico file

begin
end.
